  "description": "Years of production: 2013-2014\n\nSee the current Solaris, our steel 29er hardtail.\n\nThe Simple was our take on the world of singlespeed. In this version it grew 29\" wheels for smoothing the trail, and was based on the Solaris, its geared sibling. Singlespeeds bring a lovely element of simplicity, light weight and silence to riding a bike, and coupled with the grace, durability, clean lines and attention to detail we put into all our frames, the Simple was a ride partner for the simple life.\n\nSizes: Medium, Large and XL. Wheels: 29\".",
